 "abbrev": "CHIMR",
 "version": "0.3.0",
 "description": "A physically modeled voice: every sound comes from a simulated airway (lungs, vocal folds, tongue, lips, nose), not samples. Sing typed lyrics a syllable per key, speak them, shape vowels by hand, beatbox on the pads, or play a songbird, seal, alligator or elephant. Port of jamesondh's CHIMERA engine, lightened to run on the Move.",
 "author": "legsmechanical (engine: Jameson Hodge / CHIMERA)",
 "license": "MIT",
